{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Tape Stop Bass",
  "prompt": "driven saw and square bass on a tape loop: the master records it and plays it back through a head that slows to a stop; the mid/high band gets crisp beat-synced stutter repeats and a multiband squash over a dry mono sub",
